    {
      "id": "p0099-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This English-language joke would be lost in a straightforward translation, so the localizers replaced it with a simple joke about a Japanese proverb:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0919825,
          0.3728571,
          0.7143977,
          0.41
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0919825,
          0.3728571,
          0.7143977,
          0.41
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这个英文笑话直译成日文就会失效，因此译者换成了一个取材于日语谚语的小笑话，日版大意是：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
