    {
      "id": "p0099-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This is a comedic reference to one of the most famous proverbs in the Japanese language: “even a dog runs into a stick/pole when walking”. Originally, this proverb meant something like “if you’re too forward, you’ll meet with disaster”, but it has since gained the separate meaning of “nothing ventured, nothing gained”.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0919825,
          0.4464286,
          0.7154198,
          0.52
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0919825,
          0.4464286,
          0.7154198,
          0.52
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这里打趣的是日语中最有名的谚语之一：“狗走路也会撞到棍子／柱子。”它原本的意思近似于“过于冒进，就会遭殃”，后来又衍生出了另一层意思：“不去冒险，就不会有所收获。”",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0970927,
          0.4442857,
          0.7113317,
          0.5271429
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0970927,
          0.4442857,
          0.7113317,
          0.5271429
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0099-b009",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "This dog proverb is why so many things in Japan show dogs walking into sticks and poles",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.7297282,
          0.5292857,
          0.8728121,
          0.6092857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.7297282,
          0.5292857,
          0.8728121,
          0.6092857
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "正因为这句关于狗的谚语，日本才有那么多狗走路撞上棍子和柱子的形象。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
